WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 25)

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:02.960
Siapa lagi 

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:04.560
yang mau akting 
sama mereka?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.440
Cepat keluar!

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.640
Aduh!

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.840
Fitnah!

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.880
Mana mungkin kami

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.280
punya kerabat 
seperti Selia

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.680
Kami difitnah!

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.000
Bukankah kalian kerabat mereka?

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:17.760
Bukan

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:18.840
Mana mungkin kami punya

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.960
kerabat serendah itu

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.120
Keluarga kami dan mereka

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.600
sama sekali 
gak ada hubungan

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.280
Tuan...

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.480
Cukup! 
Jangan bicara lagi!

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.600
Kalian bisa bebas 
hukuman mati

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.200
tapi tetap akan dihukum!

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.320
Berhenti!

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:31.760
Honggo!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.000
Beraninya kamu!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.720
Direktur Utama?

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.320
Aduh

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.320
Bisa menentukan 
hidup mati orang

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.600
Tuan Honggo

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.200
hebat sekali kamu, ya

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.320
Bukan, bukan

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.720
Direktur, 
Anda salah paham

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.720
Orang-orang ini

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.760
nyamar sebagai 
orang Grup Hash

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:47.120
Selain itu

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.400
orang tua itu

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:50.800
nyamar jadi ayahmu

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.920
Tua Bangka, 
kamu lihat?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.360
Direktur kami datang

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.960
Cepat berlutut!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.800
Ayah

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.040
Aduh, aduh

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:07.560
Honggo!

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:09.160
Linken, 
datang membawa 

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.400
1 triliun 999 miliar 
999 juta rupiah

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.880
untuk melamar

